WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,710
I was completely blown away by this hot meal. This is Brother Qin.

2
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:11,510
Are you really not hurt?

3
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:15,210
Even the skin is not broken, I promise

4
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,530
Wait until the wedding is completed

5
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:20,650
I will work in the factory with peace of mind and spend more time with you and less time in the mountains.

6
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:24,840
I'll go and boil some hot water for you to take a bath.

7
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:28,980
Take a shower and Xiao Xi can meet you

8
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:33,140
It is the greatest blessing in my life to wait for me to get married in this family

9
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:38,920
You are in charge and I will listen to you

10
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:48,670
The water is getting cold. Wash it quickly. It looks so beautiful. Give it to me.

11
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:52,100
Just take it as a token of love, huh?
